<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God created man in His own image.</l><l>In His own image He created him.</l><l>Male and female He created them.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>And God blessed them and said to them,</l><l>“Be fruitful and multiply and fill the earth.”</l><l>Male and female He created them.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
